From f372d216e31ea72e8ed1e24eda8d6edabe219987 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 03:33:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: danger by max level, dense areas wait, 6 h runs;
 priest/mage caster tuning (F-219)

Universal:
- threats, camp and group levels use creature_template.maxlevel: a spawn
  rolls anywhere in the range (a level 8-9 Rotlimb counted as 8 and the
  route past it was allowed at 7)
- dense areas (5+ hostile spawns within 40 yd of the target or quest
  object: caves, mines, packed camps) wait until we are 2 levels above
  their toughest mob (the priest died 22x at 8 in Fargodeep among level-7
  kobolds)
- runs are 6 h (360 min) for the single-leg areas
Classes:
- priest: three Smites a target (one then a staff ran 80 fights past the
  budget); Power Word: Shield also as a second mob joins
- mage: Frostbolt/Fireball uncapped per target, floor 25 % mana (four bolts
  left a level-7 mob alive and the staff finished it at 10-50 health)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019SSuH6gpqY4Kn5Rk9sd149
